## 2026-07-01 (cont.)
_Two more fixes to the AI Slop-O-Vision band: (1) one-at-a-time playback was broken because `current` was only set inside the async play().then() — moved state-tracking up front and now synchronously silence all other cards on click. (2) First-click equalizer didn't animate: setting currentTime=0 on a not-yet-loaded fresh Audio made the first play() reject with a spurious AbortError, and the .catch() stripped the is-playing class (which drives the CSS eq animation). Fixed by removing the pre-play currentTime seek (rewind now in reset()/'ended' handler) and guarding the catch with `if (btn._audio.paused)`. TODO/NEXT: user is redoing the ai-slop_*.ogg assets and ADDING a Morgan Freeman voice — the new files were NOT visible in this cage session (host copy). On restart, `ls /work/assets/audio/`, then regenerate all voice buttons in _posts/2026-06-29-ai-slop-is-killing-youtube.md to match real filenames + add a Morgan Freeman card (suggested accent gold #e0a63c, avatar 🎬). Buttons are a data-driven grid of .slop-voice cards, each with inline `--v` accent, avatar emoji, name, style sub-label, data-src, data-tip._

